      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a set of Python files for integrating with a Direct Embeddings API using Google. The files are categorized into same-scenario, local helper, and later-step files. Each scored implementation file must use a concrete external provider, identifiable in the code. The local helper files will contain configuration and utility functions to support the main integration files. </thinking>\n\n",
